1. LingBot-VA (Robbyant)
   https://github.com/Robbyant/lingbot-va (commit 7c6ffa9bfc4b83582cafc860fab4c82cc7deeeeb)
   Apache License 2.0. Copyright 2024-2025 The Robbyant Team Authors.
   src/wan_va/ is adapted from the upstream package (WanTransformer3DModel, attention masks,
   causal VAE streaming wrapper, FlowMatchScheduler, activation checkpointing / FSDP helpers);
   original copyright headers are retained. The Stage 1.1 flow-matching objective
   (src/wam_policy/transfer/flow.py) follows the upstream training loss, and the 30D->9D action
   head conversion (src/wam_policy/models/) starts from the upstream checkpoint layout.
   Changes (marked "Modified by the WAM-Policy authors" in the changed files): an inference-only
   key/value cache in WanAttention (logical ids, eviction), a reference (dense) attention backend,
   lazy optional FlashAttention import, rotary dimensions rounded to even sizes, strict loading,
   explicit dtype handling, the native 9D action interface, trimmed package exports and (ablation)
   a proprioception branch. src/wan_va/modules/utils.py, utils/{scheduler,utils,logging}.py and
   distributed/fsdp.py are unmodified upstream files.

